    "progression": "STARTING = the up-to-RARE surface everyone can reach: Tianxia (the great convergence hub, biggest land) + the three starter zones Arcadia/Porthaven/Mythoria. RARE-GATED = the Sky (HS) and Underworld (UW) tiers — you need rare-tier progression to enter; they hold the legendary/mythic pets. HS3 + UW3 (highest sky / deepest hell) reach MYTHIC. CGI/KOL prestige islands = legendary/mythic residents only.",
    "gateMeaning": "rarityMin..rarityMax = the inclusive rarity band a pet must fall in to spawn/recruit in the zone. So a 'rare..legendary' zone spawns NO common/uncommon; a 'common..rare' starter spawns no legendary/mythic. Common(31)/uncommon(81)/rare(80) live in the starting band (~192 pets, open to all); legendary(26) gated to HS/UW; mythic(10) only HS3/UW3/CGI/KOL.",
    "source": "docs/populace-pet-spec/pets-aptitudes.csv (228 typed pets, 17 elements, 5 rarities)",
    "domainNote": "domain = the zones dominant Master domain (data/pet-domains.json). Light rules the sky+prestige, Shadow the underworld, elemental domains the surface."
